---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: The subjects every electrical engineering student has to take, in under ten minutes each.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">For electrical engineering students</span>
    <h1>Confused to competent, in under ten minutes.</h1>
    <p>VccLabs teaches the subjects every electrical engineering student on the planet has to take. Power electronics, Fourier transforms, calculus. All interactive, no fluff.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/volts/llc-resonant-converter/">Start with the LLC converter</a>
      <a class="btn-quiet" href="#how">What is a volt?</a>
    </div>
  </div>

    <figure class="hero-fig" data-hero-wave>
    <span class="fig-tag">Live volt widget</span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 520 150" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-label="A waveform built from its harmonics">
      <line class="axis" x1="0" y1="75" x2="520" y2="75"/>
      <line class="w-gibbs" x1="0" y1="16.1" x2="520" y2="16.1"/>
      <line class="w-gibbs" x1="0" y1="133.9" x2="520" y2="133.9"/>
      <path class="w-target" d=""/>
      <path class="w-sum" d=""/>
    </svg>
    <div class="fig-modes" role="group" aria-label="Waveform">
      <button type="button" data-hw-mode="sq" class="is-on">Square</button>
      <button type="button" data-hw-mode="saw">Sawtooth</button>
      <button type="button" data-hw-mode="tri">Triangle</button>
    </div>
    <div class="fig-ctl">
      <button type="button" class="hw-play" data-hw-play aria-pressed="false">Play</button>
      <input type="range" min="1" max="15" step="1" value="1" data-hw-n aria-label="Highest harmonic">
      <span class="hw-read" data-hw-read>n ≤ 1</span>
    </div>
        <figcaption>Add harmonics and the sines converge on the waveform. The amber lines mark the 9% Gibbs overshoot at a jump — it never goes away. This is a volt slide, running here.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="how" id="how">
  <h2>How a volt works</h2>
  <div class="how-grid">
    <div class="how-item">
      <span class="n">01</span>
      <h3>A deck, not a chapter</h3>
      <p>Fifteen to twenty slides on one idea. No preamble, no worked-example padding, no chapter you have to read twice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="how-item">
      <span class="n">02</span>
      <h3>The figures move</h3>
      <p>Drag the resonant tank and watch the gain curve answer. The interactive is the explanation, not an illustration beside it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="how-item">
      <span class="n">03</span>
      <h3>Every number is exact</h3>
      <p>Real design values at real operating points, with the corners where the maths stops being true called out on the slide.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="volt-list">
  <h2>The library</h2>
  {% for volt in volts %}
    {% if volt.status == "published" %}
    <a class="volt-card" href="/volts/{{ volt.slug }}/">
      <span class="volt-subject">{{ volt.subject }}</span>
      <span class="volt-title">{{ volt.title }}</span>
      <span class="volt-blurb">{{ volt.blurb }}</span>
      <span class="volt-duration">{{ volt.minutes }} minute volt</span>
    </a>
    {% else %}
    <div class="volt-card is-draft">
      <span class="volt-subject">{{ volt.subject }}</span>
      <span class="volt-title">{{ volt.title }}</span>
      <span class="volt-blurb">{{ volt.blurb }}</span>
      <span class="volt-duration">In production</span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="pro">
  <div class="pro-copy">
    <h2>Pro pass</h2>
    <p>Every volt in the library, one annual pass. <b>$39 a year</b> — about the price of one textbook chapter you would have skimmed anyway.</p>
  </div>
  <span class="pro-state">Opening soon</span>
</section>